SUMMARY:Kracht: Upper A
DESCRIPTION:Benen rust (powerhike telt als herstel). Na of vóór het powe
 rhiken.\nBankdrukken (barbell) 3×6–8 @RIR2\nIncline dumbbell press 3×8
 –10 @RIR2\nChest-supported row 3×8–10 @RIR2\nLateral raise 3×12–15
  @RIR1\nCable/machine fly 2×10–12 @RIR1\nTriceps pushdown 2×10–12 @R
 IR1\nPallof press (per kant) 2×10–12 @RIR2
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-16-b@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T222558Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261116
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261117
SUMMARY:Lopen: Powerhike loopband 30 min
DESCRIPTION:Herstel na de race én eerste Mozart-hoogtemeters.\nLoopband 1
 2–15% helling\, 5\,0–5\,5 km/u wandelen\, HF < 130\, niet rennen\, han
 den los.\n≈ 350–400 hm. Stop bij kuit- of rugklachten.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-17-a@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T222558Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261118
SUMMARY:Lopen: Easy 8 km + 6 strides
DESCRIPTION:HF ≤ 145 · 5:40–6:00/km · RPE 2–3\nBenen nog zwaar van
  de race? Dan geen strides.\nStrides 6 × 20 s @ ~3:45/km-gevoel\, 80 s he
 rstel.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-17-b@coach
DTSTAMP:20261115T222558Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261118
SUMMARY:Kracht: Plyo + Lower A (RIR 3)
DESCRIPTION:Eén gymbezoek\, minstens 3 uur na de run. Start met plyo (fri
 s\, kwaliteit > volume). Squat en RDL: RIR 3 deze week omdat ze stillagen\
 , techniek eerst\; volgende week normaal opbouwen.\nPogo jumps 3×15\nLate
 rale pogo's (per kant) 2×10\nSnap-down → verticale sprong 3×3\nBox jum
 p (stap eraf) 3×3\nBack squat 3×5–6 @RIR3\nRomanian deadlift 3×6–8 
 @RIR3\nBulgarian split squat (per been\, dumbbells totaal) 3×6–8 @RIR3\
 nStaande calf raise 3×8–12 @RIR1\nTibialis raise 2×15–20 @RIR1\nCope
 nhagen plank (sec per kant) 2×20–30 @RIR2
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
